From 906636e907ce36dd13feafc89824d22cb406925e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rainow <rainow@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:23:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(remote): resolve in-root absolute workspace reads for
 image envelopes

Remote clients that anchor a read on the session file send the absolute path
from an image envelope (<path>/abs/workspace.png</path>). Treat such a path as a
plain root-relative target when it is inside the workspace instead of rejecting
it as outside-root; URL-scheme and out-of-root paths keep failing. Also record
the requested path on failed workspace calls so operator logs are actionable.
---
 packages/plugin/src/harness-remote-bridge.ts  | 39 ++++++++++++++-----
 .../tests/harness-remote-bridge.test.ts       | 32 ++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

